{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"bf8ac3e99e40c1f28c7b008916b6d92af06c8bc430518936748717cbda56ce15","digest":{"component_or_area":"plan-review and code-review sidecars","key_entities":["src/rebar/llm/plan_review/sidecar.py","src/rebar/llm/code_review/sidecar.py","plan_review_result_v2","code_review_result_v2","plan_review_verdict.schema.json","build_payload","coaching[]","move_id","move_name","subject","finding_refs"],"problem_keywords":["lossless persistence","pass-4 coaching","sidecar payload","data loss","audit trail"],"propositions":["The plan-review sidecar persists pass-4 coaching notes with only move_id and finding_refs, dropping move_name, subject, and rendered coaching prose, preventing downstream audit UI from reconstructing the full coaching record.","The full coaching record shape per plan_review_verdict.schema.json is {move_id, move_name, subject, finding_refs[], coaching}, but the sidecar's _slim projection only captures 2 fields, violating the epic's lossless capture goal.","The plan-review sidecar build_payload must be changed to persist all five fields of each coaching note instead of the current slim 2-field projection.","The code-review sidecar already persists pass-4 coaching losslessly via build_payload storing verdict.get(\"coaching\", []) verbatim, and this behavior must be locked in with a regression test."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785822366139529391,"uuid":"b2002268-fc6d-4280-90ac-fb6486b82b0d"}